      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58c6cbcffd04b1785f747b6c|full_name}: Here's a solution to the first problem at least.\n\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/option-to-auto-decline-remote-friend-requests\n\nFor the second, I suppose you'd call it Friends Invite Only? XD\n\nOr we could cede that showing the instance owner of a friends only world isn't a big deal and if people want to hide that much, they may as well use a private world instead.",
